  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Magic action: create your Eldritch Cannon (from the module's Summoned Creatures compendium) within 5 ft - once per Long Rest, or by spending a spell slot. Its HP is 5 x your Artificer level; its Flamethrower, Force Ballista and Protector use your spell DC, spell attack and Intelligence modifier. Activate it with a Bonus Action (use its activities); it lasts 1 hour, and a new cannon replaces the old one (the module removes it). Force Ballista pushes a creature 5 ft away from the cannon (module).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
